  "threshold_protocol": "Thresholds are selected on out-of-fold predictions over the development wells and then frozen. The external wells are used only to score them, so sensitivity and referral rate are out-of-sample in both the model and the cut-off. Bootstrap 95% intervals accompany each point.",
